## Staleness

Every file in this set is stamped with the commit it was verified against.
Compare that SHA with `HEAD`:

```bash
git log --oneline <short-sha>..HEAD -- <the paths this set describes>
```

If that range contains changes to build files, entry points, or the paths named
in ARCHITECTURE.md, this set is probably out of date. Re-run the
crv-codebase-onboarding skill; it will detect `refresh` mode automatically.

